    Options:
    - OptionText:
        GlocText: 'When your changes create orphans: - Remove imports/variables/functions
          that YOUR changes made unused. - Don''t remove pre-existing dead code unless
          asked.  The test: Every changed line should trace directly to the user''s
          request.'
